					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Cautiously upvoting because I enjoy the absurdity of this and could not stop laughing, but I can't tell if that's due to my being tired + mental state or not.</p> <p>I like that self-portrait. For a bird, it's pretty damn good.</p> <p>EDIT: One suggestion; don't translate nearly every phrase, to save up on footnotes. If you do keep getting questions, leave many of the phrases up to the reader to interpret, and let Edison only translate the ones that seem really necessary, in his view.</p> 
